recommend keep-going the whole-body printing carry is spent, and what remains is the staircase: bodies where each rung's is the rung below's plus its own tier, which the meter counts as roughly ninety already-written lines apiece. That wants fold D's comptime seam one tier deeper rather than a whole-body lift, so size it from PRINT_LINES against PRINT_BODIES before moving a line -- the two readings disagree on purpose here, and the disagreement is the design call. Verify reach as pub first regardless; it is what has made every fold in this arc safe.
